    <tags>pluck cli file-sharing ephemeral self-hosted upload download</tags>
    <summary>CLI client for the Pluck ephemeral file-sharing platform</summary>
    <description>
Pluck CLI is a feature-rich command-line client for the Pluck self-hosted ephemeral file-sharing platform.

Features:
- Upload and share files with automatic expiry (TTL) and download limits
- Real-time upload/download progress tracking with Spectre.Console UI
- Automatic clipboard integration for generated download URLs
- Password-protected file sharing
- User management (admin) commands
- API key generation

Requires a self-hosted Pluck API instance. See the project README for setup instructions.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/TruePadawan/Pluck/releases</releaseNotes>
